sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as SearchService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    B->>S: GET /search?q=metformin iyer (after typing pauses)
    S->>S: split into words (≤ 6), escape LIKE wildcards
    S->>DB: documents of this user where EVERY word matches title, summary,<br/>doctor, facility, file name, page text, test or medicine name
    DB-->>S: ids in timeline order (≤ 50)
    S->>DB: load those documents (owner-scoped)
    S->>DB: first page containing the first word, per document
    S-->>B: documents + snippet + page number
